      "id": "claim_355269bdd0da44d8b818bd217a69284c",
      "statement": "dma_memcopy.sv implements NUM_CH independent copy channels, each using its own channel index as its AXI ID (AWID/ARID) on a shared AXI4 master DMA port, so concurrently-started channels have multiple outstanding transactions tagged by distinct IDs.",
