      "statement": "AR/AW issuance among dma_memcopy's channels is arbitrated fixed-priority (lowest channel index wins) one grant per cycle, but multiple channels can still have bursts outstanding simultaneously since only issuance is serialized; R/B responses are demultiplexed back to the owning channel purely by AXI ID.",
